#Screens
screen.POSTPROC = 后期处理
screen.POSTPROC.comment = 色调映射、相机特效与抗锯齿。
screen.TONEMAP = 色调映射
screen.TONEMAP.comment = 应用到 HDR 场景的显示渲染变换。
screen.CAMERA = 相机与特效
screen.CAMERA.comment = 景深、运动模糊、泛光与自动曝光。
screen.ANTIALIASING = 抗锯齿
screen.ANTIALIASING.comment = 时域抗锯齿与 FidelityFX CAS 锐化。
screen.LIGHTING = 光照
screen.LIGHTING.comment = 阴影质量、环境光遮蔽与环境光/人工光。
screen.AMBIENT = 环境光
